# Shelfmark — Library Management System

React frontend + Node/Express API + PostgreSQL (PGlite locally).

## Backend structure

```text
backend/
├── server.js                 # entry point
├── .env
└── src/
    ├── app.js                # Express app + middleware
    ├── config/               # env / app config
    ├── db/                   # DB connection (PGlite or Postgres)
    ├── sql/                  # schema.sql + seed
    ├── routes/               # HTTP route definitions
    ├── controllers/          # request/response handlers
    ├── services/             # business logic
    ├── middleware/           # auth + error handlers
    └── utils/                # helpers (response, mappers, ids)
```

## Run

### Backend
```bash
cd backend
npm install
npm run dev
```
API: `http://localhost:5000/api`

### Frontend
```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```
App: `http://localhost:5173`  
Vite proxies `/api` → `http://localhost:5000`.

### Seed logins
| Role   | Email                   | Password  |
|--------|-------------------------|-----------|
| Member | priya@shelfmark.local   | member123 |
| Admin  | admin@shelfmark.local   | admin123  |

## Database

- Default: embedded **PGlite** in `backend/data/`
- Real Postgres: set `DATABASE_URL` in `backend/.env`

